note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note Combine measured owned page backing with other caller-accounted allocations.
note Caller serializes policy and pool; this does not authenticate snapshot contents.
fn rpool other ulong to int
if gt other 1125899906842624
put rcontrol 6 1125899906842625
else
put rcontrol 6 add other pbytes
end
ret rselect
end
